  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion.<br>• Drain sweetcorn.<br>• Drain and rinse black beans. Transfer to a bowl and roughly mash.<br>• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686e042efa13aea4b988ab82/step-8a848900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins.<br>• Stir in garlic, tomato paste and spicy taco seasoning (the spice blend is hot, use less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and cook until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Add beans and the butter and cook until softened, 3-4 mins.<br>• Stir in the water and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Lightly mash. Season with salt and pepperto taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686e042efa13aea4b988ab82/step-8487ef10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Arrange tortillas over a lined oven tray. Divide bean mixture over half of each tortilla and top with Cheddar cheese. Fold each tortilla over and gently press with a spatula.<br>• Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686e042efa13aea4b988ab82/step-1478b120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Bake quesadillas until golden and cheese has melted, 10-12 mins. (Place baking paper and a second oven tray on quesadillas if they unfold in the oven.)<br>• Meanwhile, add tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil to the charred corn. Toss to combine and season to taste.<br>• Divide quesadillas between plates. Top with with sour cream and salsa to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686e042efa13aea4b988ab82/step-ed7d4c30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
